<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Dr Pepper | The 23 Flavors</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        'dp-maroon': '#711A38',
                        'dp-black': '#1A1A1A',
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Helvetica Neue', 'Arial', 'sans-serif'],
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        /* Custom sensory animation for the hero text */
        @keyframes float {
            0% { transform: translateY(0px); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
            100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
        }
        .animate-float {
            animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        /* Smooth scrolling */
        html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-dp-black text-white font-sans antialiased selection:bg-dp-maroon selection:text-white">

    <nav class="w-full p-6 flex justify-between items-center absolute top-0 z-50">
        <div class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tighter text-white uppercase italic">
            Dr Pepper
        </div>
        <a href="#join" class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide hover:text-dp-maroon transition-colors duration-300">
            Pepper Perks
        </a>
    </nav>

    <header class="relative w-full min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center px-4 overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-dp-maroon to-dp-black">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/carbon-fibre.png')] opacity-10 mix-blend-overlay"></div>
        
        <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-16 animate-float">
            <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6 drop-shadow-lg">
                Misunderstood by Many.<br> <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-red-400 to-red-600">Mastered by 23.</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg md:text-2xl font-light max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 text-gray-200">
                Stop settling for standard. Crack open the unapologetic taste of Dr Pepper and unlock exclusive, limited-edition rewards with Pepper Perks.
            </p>
            <a href="#join" class="inline-block bg-white text-dp-maroon font-bold text-lg px-10 py-4 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.3)] hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(255,255,255,0.5)] hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300 uppercase tracking-widest">
                Unlock Your Perks
            </a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="w-full py-24 bg-dp-black px-4 border-b border-gray-800">
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
            <div class="space-y-6">
                <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black uppercase text-white">A Symphony of <span class="text-dp-maroon">23 Secret Flavors.</span></h2>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed">
                    Sweet, savory, and entirely defiant. We’ve spent over a century guarding the formula that makes every icy sip entirely unique. It’s not a cola. It’s not a root beer. It’s Dr Pepper.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full h-80 bg-dp-maroon rounded-2xl shadow-2xl flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden group">
                 <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black opacity-20 group-hover:opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>
                 <div class="text-8xl font-black text-white opacity-10 scale-150 absolute transform -rotate-12 group-hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-700">23</div>
                 <p class="text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-widest z-10">The Vault is Sealed</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="join" class="w-full py-24 bg-gradient-to-t from-dp-maroon to-dp-black px-4 text-center">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8">
            <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black uppercase text-white drop-shadow-md">Join the Flavor Cult.</h2>
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-200 font-light">
                True Peppers don't just drink it; they live it. Join the Pepper Perks program today to earn points on every sip, score exclusive merch, and get early access to vault flavors.
            </p>
            
            <form class="mt-8 max-w-md mx-auto flex flex-col gap-4" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('Welcome to Pepper Perks! (This is a demo)');">
                <input type="email" placeholder="Enter your email" required class="w-full px-6 py-4 rounded-full bg-white text-dp-black font-bold focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 focus:ring-red-500 transition-all placeholder-gray-500">
                <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-dp-black text-white font-black text-lg px-10 py-4 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-900 border border-transparent hover:border-gray-700 transition-all duration-300 uppercase tracking-widest shadow-xl">
                    Claim Free Welcome Points
                </button>
            </form>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-4">No commitment. Just 23 flavors of rewards.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="w-full py-8 bg-dp-black text-center border-t border-gray-900">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">&copy; 2026 Dr Pepper. All Rights Reserved. (Demo Concept)</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
